{"id":"huntik:page:3440","page_id":3440,"title":"Teknonomicon","kind":"item","namespace":0,"summary":"The Teknonomicon is a black tome used by the Organization. The Teknonomicon was invented by Klaus through reverse engineering the Huntik Foundation's Holotome. Like the standard Holotome, this device provides stat and ability information on Titans as well as data on locations and spells. It can also be relayed visual surveillance from the eye of Mindrone. The device appears only to be given to high ranking members or selected suits of the Organization as not many members are seen carrying them. The images produced by Teknonomicon are light green. \n\nThe audio playback of Rassimov's Teknonomicon seems to have a thick Russian accent, although this is probably specific to his. Grier possesses a similar device, albeit with an orange-yellow display. The audio playback of his tome is not, however, similarly accented. .","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:Teknonomicon.png","wikitext":"File:Teknonomicon.png","links":[]},"type":{"text":"Tome","wikitext":"Tome","links":[]},"first":{"text":"Into the River of Secrets","wikitext":"[[Into the River of Secrets]]","links":[{"target_title":"Into the River of Secrets","label":"Into the River of Secrets","target_id":"huntik:page:2642","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Into_the_River_of_Secrets","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2642"}]},"effects":{"text":"Research and Communication","wikitext":"Research and Communication","links":[]},"source":{"text":"Reverse-engineered from the Holotome","wikitext":"Reverse-engineered from the [[Holotome]]","links":[{"target_title":"Holotome","label":"Holotome","target_id":"huntik:page:2679","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Holotome","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2679"}]},"users":{"text":"The Organization","wikitext":"[[The Organization]]","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox item","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:Teknonomicon.png","value_text":"File:Teknonomicon.png","links":[]},{"name":"type","value_wikitext":"Tome","value_text":"Tome","links":[]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"[[Into the River of Secrets]]","value_text":"Into the River of Secrets","links":[{"target_title":"Into the River of Secrets","label":"Into the River of Secrets","target_id":"huntik:page:2642","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Into_the_River_of_Secrets","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2642"}]},{"name":"effects","value_wikitext":"Research and Communication","value_text":"Research and Communication","links":[]},{"name":"source","value_wikitext":"Reverse-engineered from the [[Holotome]]","value_text":"Reverse-engineered from the Holotome","links":[{"target_title":"Holotome","label":"Holotome","target_id":"huntik:page:2679","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Holotome","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2679"}]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[The Organization]]","value_text":"The Organization","links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"}]}],"start":0,"end":254}],"sections":[{"heading":"Titan Profiles","level":2,"wikitext":"* [[Tao]] (\"[[To Be Together]]\")\n* [[King Basilisk]] (\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\")\n* [[Nordrake]] (\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\")\n\n{{for|a full listing of profiles|Titan Profile database}}\n\n{{clear}}","text":"* Tao (\"To Be Together\")\n* King Basilisk (\"The Divine Comedy\")\n* Nordrake (\"The Divine Comedy\")"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\">\nS1E09 Teknonomicon Zhalia Cherit Lok Sophie.png|Surveillance function relayed from the eye of a [[Mindrone]]\nS1E17 Teknonomicon communication.png|Communication Function\nS1E23 Tao Teknonomicon.png|Titan Profile of [[Tao]]\nS1E24 Zhalia teknonomikon.jpg\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Tomes]]\n[[Category:The Organization]]","text":"S1E09 Teknonomicon Zhalia Cherit Lok Sophie.png|Surveillance function relayed from the eye of a Mindrone\nS1E17 Teknonomicon communication.png|Communication Function\nS1E23 Tao Teknonomicon.png|Titan Profile of Tao\nS1E24 Zhalia teknonomikon.jpg"}],"full_text":"The Teknonomicon is a black tome used by the Organization. The Teknonomicon was invented by Klaus through reverse engineering the Huntik Foundation's Holotome. [TCG:OAL-022] Like the standard Holotome, this device provides stat and ability information on Titans as well as data on locations and spells. It can also be relayed visual surveillance from the eye of Mindrone. [Absent Heroes] The device appears only to be given to high ranking members or selected suits of the Organization as not many members are seen carrying them. The images produced by Teknonomicon are light green. \n\nThe audio playback of Rassimov's Teknonomicon seems to have a thick Russian accent, although this is probably specific to his. Grier possesses a similar device, albeit with an orange-yellow display. The audio playback of his tome is not, however, similarly accented. [An Ally from the Organization].\n\n== Titan Profiles ==\n* Tao (\"To Be Together\")\n* King Basilisk (\"The Divine Comedy\")\n* Nordrake (\"The Divine Comedy\")\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E09 Teknonomicon Zhalia Cherit Lok Sophie.png|Surveillance function relayed from the eye of a Mindrone\nS1E17 Teknonomicon communication.png|Communication Function\nS1E23 Tao Teknonomicon.png|Titan Profile of Tao\nS1E24 Zhalia teknonomikon.jpg","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox item\n| image      = File:Teknonomicon.png\n| type       = Tome\n| first      = [[Into the River of Secrets]]\n| effects    = Research and Communication\n| source     = Reverse-engineered from the [[Holotome]] \n| users      = [[The Organization]]\n}}\nThe '''Teknonomicon''' is a black [[tome]] used by [[the Organization]]. The Teknonomicon was invented by [[Klaus]] through reverse engineering the [[Huntik Foundation|Huntik Foundation's]] [[Holotome]]. {{Source|TCG:OAL-022|OAL-022}} Like the standard Holotome, this device provides stat and ability information on Titans as well as data on locations and spells. It can also be relayed visual surveillance from the eye of [[Mindrone]]. {{source|Absent Heroes}} The device appears only to be given to high ranking members or selected suits of the Organization as not many members are seen carrying them. The images produced by Teknonomicon are light green. \n\nThe audio playback of [[Rassimov|Rassimov's]] Teknonomicon seems to have a thick Russian accent, although this is probably specific to his. Grier possesses a similar device, albeit with an orange-yellow display. The audio playback of his tome is not, however, similarly accented. {{source|An Ally from the Organization}}.\n\n== Titan Profiles ==\n* [[Tao]] (\"[[To Be Together]]\")\n* [[King Basilisk]] (\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\")\n* [[Nordrake]] (\"[[The Divine Comedy]]\")\n\n{{for|a full listing of profiles|Titan Profile database}}\n\n{{clear}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery captionalign=\"center\" position=\"center\">\nS1E09 Teknonomicon Zhalia Cherit Lok Sophie.png|Surveillance function relayed from the eye of a [[Mindrone]]\nS1E17 Teknonomicon communication.png|Communication Function\nS1E23 Tao Teknonomicon.png|Titan Profile of [[Tao]]\nS1E24 Zhalia teknonomikon.jpg\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Tomes]]\n[[Category:The Organization]]","categories":["The Organization","Tomes"],"links":[{"target_title":"Into the River of Secrets","label":"Into the River of Secrets","target_id":"huntik:page:2642","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Into_the_River_of_Secrets","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2642"},{"target_title":"Holotome","label":"Holotome","target_id":"huntik:page:2679","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Holotome","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2679"},{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"tome","label":"tome","target_id":"huntik:page:3438","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/tome","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3438"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_id":"huntik:page:3241","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_title":"Huntik Foundation","label":"Huntik Foundation's","target_id":"huntik:page:1987","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Huntik_Foundation","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1987"},{"target_title":"Holotome","label":"Holotome","target_id":"huntik:page:2679","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Holotome","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2679"},{"target_title":"Mindrone","label":"Mindrone","target_id":"huntik:page:2103","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mindrone","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2103"},{"target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov's","target_id":"huntik:page:2090","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_title":"Tao","label":"Tao","target_id":"huntik:page:2421","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Tao","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2421"},{"